Historical Israel/Gaza comparison
---------------------------------
Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2023), obtained through Element 84
Earth Search and the AWS Sentinel-2 L2A COG archive. Cropped true-color scenes
from 27 September 2023 and 1 November 2023. Provenance and source asset URLs are
in frontend/public/historical/provenance.json. Processing: RGB crop and bilinear
resampling, without synthetic alterations. Regional comparison only; not a
building-level damage assessment or evidence of cause or responsibility.
Terms: https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/documents/247904/690755/Sentinel_Data_Legal_Notice


